'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 6''' was the sixth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 15, 2026 at the Aizawa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Aizawa]] — the second consecutive night in the champion's home city. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 3 matches.

The night is remembered for the block's stylistic war reaching its peak: [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] and [[Jusuf Muntasir]] — the shooting star and the truth-teller — producing the tournament's most polarizing match; [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]] facing [[Mamadou Diallo|Mamadou "The Hammer" Diallo]], the family warrior against the last loyal Cannon Club man; and [[Takagi Yuto]] and [[Jin Tanaka|Jin "Bulldog" Tanaka]] keeping the block's top tight.

