== Storyline notes ==

* '''Three undefeated in Block B.''' KAZUKI, Takagi, and Taumafa all stand at 3-0, 6 points — and the round-robin guarantees the collisions: KAZUKI vs. Takagi (Round 5, Naruto), Taumafa vs. Takagi (Round 8, Tsuda), and KAZUKI vs. Taumafa (Round 9, Toyozawa). Only one man can run the table.
* '''Jusuf bumped.''' The truth-teller's refusal to sell has been the tournament's most polarizing story — and against KAZUKI, the man who cannot be ignored, Jusuf took the bump for the Twin Star Press. The wrestling press is already arguing about what it means. Jusuf is 1-2, and the mosaraza is being tested by the block's best.
* '''The family's G1 runs hot.''' While the chief drops points in Block A, Taumafa is perfect in Block B. The Kuroshio brothers' cousin is one of three undefeated men in the tournament — and the projected Taumafa vs. Takagi collision in Tsuda is now the block's marquee remaining match.
* '''Kuroki and Ono are alive.''' Both entered the night winless; both left with points and momentum. Kuroki's first win came against his own faction brother, cleanly; Ono's came with the young lion's relief. The bottom of Block B is tightening.

